            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading": "<h2>Accuracy is at Our Core</h2>"
          }
        },
        "text_pm6rJa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Bystronic Xpert and Cincinnati brake presses are known as some of the most accurate and high precision brakes available, capable of forming metals within a half-degree of accuracy. Their large beds allow for greater flexibility across different sheet sizes and configurations. Backed by our skilled team of brake press operators and engineers, we calculate exact bend radius, bend lines, and compensate for material thickness and part thickness throughout the bending process. Whether you need a single bent part or a full production run of custom metal components, we take pride in delivering consistent, high-quality results.</p>"
          }
